<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT -  PhyCor rated hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT -  PhyCor rated hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- McDonald &amp; Co analyst Stephen Denelsky said Tuesday he initiated coverage of PhyCor with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- PhyCor, with a revenue base of $442 million in 1995 up from $64 million in 1990, is building physician-driven managed care networks.</p>
<p>-- In a report, Denelsky said investors should hold PhyCor shares at its current price and buy on drops in the stock price or below the $30 a share level.</p>
<p>-- PhyCor shares were down 1-3/4 at 31.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
